<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 22.845 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 22.845 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell 50 basis points to 22.8450 percent Monday from 23.3450 percent Thursday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised each working day.</p>
<p>The Mexican markets were closed Friday.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
